{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o133b","title":"王祥为三老郑小同为五更曹髦行礼","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o133b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"王祥为三老郑小同为五更曹髦行礼","evidence":["shaodi-e-o133b-q"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9163697031bc1376f522","label":"裴注·王隐《晋书》","text":"王隐《晋书》：高贵乡公入学，以祥为三老","evidence":["lizang-q-f0f1aaa1ab20ecad6ac8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0123","role":"三老","evidence":["shaodi-e-o133b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0081","role":"五更","evidence":["shaodi-e-o133b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0068","role":"行礼","evidence":["shaodi-e-o133b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":258,"label":"丙寅","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y258","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o129","basis":"丙寅"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o133b-q","shaodi-q-o129","shaodi-q-b-ee7d999da8e03b038d07"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o133b-q","source_order":[4,580,"O133b"],"order":1202}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0068","name":"曹髦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0081","name":"郑小同","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0123","name":"王祥","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-f0f1aaa1ab20ecad6ac8","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f3c9370bada62331f7ff","layer":"pei","quote":"高贵乡公入学，以祥为三老","attribution":"裴注·王隐《晋书》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bac345b63c40d7fb8707","start":28,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o133b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-af667b138ffffa42f780","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，甲戌〖23〗，以骠骑将军王昶为司空。丙寅〖24〗，诏曰：“夫养老兴教，三代所以树风化垂不朽也。必有三老、五更以崇至敬〖25〗，乞言纳诲〖26〗，著在惇史〖27〗；然后六合承流〖28〗，下观而化〖29〗。宜妙简德行〖30〗，以充其选。关内侯王祥〖31〗，履仁秉义，雅志淳固。关内侯郑小同，温恭孝友，率礼不忒〖32〗。其以祥为三老，小同为五更。”车驾亲率群司〖33〗，躬行古礼焉。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":579,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ee7d999da8e03b038d07","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ee7d999da8e03b038d07","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：甘露三年（公元 258）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":582,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-663d9ce877d00f2d0cbc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o129","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1abcd215d0c852fc17c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖1〗，大将军司马文王陷寿春城，斩诸葛诞。三月，诏曰：“古者克敌，收其尸以为京观〖2〗，所以惩昏逆而彰武功也。汉孝武元鼎中〖3〗，改桐乡为闻喜〖4〗，新乡为获嘉〖5〗，以著南越之亡〖6〗。大将军亲总六戎〖7〗，营据丘头〖8〗；内夷群凶〖9〗，外殄寇虏〖10〗；功济兆民，声振四海。克敌之地，宜有令名〖11〗：其改‘丘头’为‘武丘’。明以武平乱，后世不忘；亦京观、二邑之义也〖12〗”。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
